section__
  @title "Riverrun Broken Oath under rain"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "medium"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/05-act5-battlefront/frame-340.jpg"

  "Under Riverrun rain, wet leather and cold iron fill the tent where oaths are being contested. House Valehart now sits at the hinge of three theaters, and your ruling here will redirect riders, stores, and hostages before dawn. Brienne of Tarth tests your posture in public while Jaime Lannister studies your pauses for weakness, and every scribe in the room is already drafting competing versions of your intent.

The field is eating men faster than replacement lines can march. Attrition is no longer abstract; it is visible in empty shield ranks before noon.

You can distribute sacrifice transparently and risk slower action, or force outcomes through hidden pressure and keep momentum at the cost of trust. The next move will decide whether fear or discipline carries your front."

  choice__
    @target "The Kingsroad Blackmail Ledger after the feast"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Issue terms before witnesses, accept the delay, and bind every banner to one enforceable line of command."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "The Red Keep Raven Intercept before the sept bell"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 5)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 2, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Summon key holdouts in private, trade threats for obedience, and move before dissent hardens into mutiny."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "Winterfell Night Council before witnesses"
    @when ((wealth + essos_ties + dragon_factor) >= 7)
    @action wealth = clampStat(wealth - 1, 0, 30)
    @action essos_ties = clampStat(essos_ties + 1, 0, 30)
    @action dragon_factor = clampStat(dragon_factor + 1, 0, 30)
    "Spend coin on Essosi couriers and dragon-backed deterrence, buying speed while draining treasury reserves."
  __choice
